# google-services.json and debug.keystore are COMMITTED on purpose so a collaborator can
# clone, build and sign in immediately: this repo must stay PRIVATE. The Firebase key is a
# client identifier, not a secret — access is enforced by firestore.rules, and the API key
# should be restricted (package name + SHA-1) in Google Cloud console. Never make this repo
# public without purging these from history first.

